# Build-context filter for Dockerfile.uvlhub.dev (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). Paths are relative to the
# context, the workspace root. The image only copies pyproject files, so this
# just keeps caches and dependencies out of the context sent to the builder.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/.pytest_cache
**/.git
.splent_cache
